{"meta":{"id":"basic-types","category":"it/syntax/typescript/types","title":"기본 타입 · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"string · number · boolean · null · undefined · bigint · symbol · any · unknown · void · never, type 별칭","tags":["typescript","f-types"],"color":"sky","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-sky","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-sky-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">기본 타입 · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> string · number · boolean · null · undefined · bigint · symbol · any · unknown · void · never, type 별칭</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">기본 타입</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">타입</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">예시</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>string</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">문자열</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>&quot;hello&quot;</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>number</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">숫자(정수, 실수)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>10, 3.14</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>boolean</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">참 또는 거짓</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>true, false</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>null</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">값이 없음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>null</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>undefined</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">값이 정의되지 않음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>undefined</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>bigint</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">큰 정수</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>100n</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>symbol</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">고유한 식별자</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Symbol(&quot;id&quot;)</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>any</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">타입 검사 제한</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>어떤 타입이든 허용</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>unknown</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">알 수 없는 타입</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>사용 전 타입 확인 필요</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>void</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">반환값이 없는 함수</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>function log(): void</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>never</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">정상적으로 끝나지 않는 값</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>예외 발생, 무한 루프 등</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>type</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">타입의 형태 지정 (타입의 별명)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>type UserId = string | number;</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">변수 선언</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">let userName: string = &quot;hello&quot;;\r\nlet age: number = 10;\r\nlet isAdmin: boolean = false;\r\nlet big: bigint = 100n;\r\nconst id: symbol = Symbol(&quot;id&quot;);\r\n\r\nlet empty: null = null;\r\nlet notYet: undefined = undefined;\r\n\r\n// 타입 추론 — 초기값이 있으면 타입을 적지 않아도 된다\r\nlet count = 0;        // number 로 추론</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>let</code> 은 재할당 가능, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>const</code> 는 재할당 불가. 초기값이 있으면 타입 표기를 생략해도 추론됨</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">type — 타입 별칭</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">type UserId = string | number;\r\n\r\nlet a: UserId = &quot;u-001&quot;;\r\nlet b: UserId = 1001;\r\n\r\ntype Point = { x: number; y: number };\r\nconst p: Point = { x: 1, y: 2 };</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">자주 쓰는 타입 조합에 이름을 붙여 재사용한다. 객체 형태는 interface 로도 정의 가능 (객체 · 컬렉션 › 인터페이스)</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">any vs unknown</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">let a: any = &quot;text&quot;;\r\na.toFixed();          // 컴파일 통과 → 실행 시 오류\r\n\r\nlet u: unknown = &quot;text&quot;;\r\n// u.toUpperCase();   // 오류: 사용 전 타입 확인 필요\r\nif (typeof u === &quot;string&quot;) {\r\n  u.toUpperCase();    // 확인 후 사용 가능\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/types/basic-types","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"types","title":"기본 타입","path":"it/syntax/typescript/types"}],"hasImage":false}